  ;; ==========================================================================
  ;; Map / Set instance methods (dispatch-table migration, batch 2 —
  ;; "Map / Set instance methods
  ;; (slice 5)" per the original dispatch_builtin_method comment).
  ;; receiver_pointer is the Map or Set header pointer; receiver_type is
  ;; TYPE_MAP or TYPE_SET. Header layout (offsets from header_pointer):
  ;;   +8 size (live count, excludes tombstones), +12 slotCount,
  ;;   +16 capacity, +20 entriesHeader.
