    ;; slotCount reaches capacity — for an already-large Map that grow
    ;; can exceed the dispatcher's heap-slack headroom in one
    ;; instruction. Pressure-signaled return 0 BEFORE any mutation:
    ;; $run's CALL_METHOD rollback restores the pending stack and
    ;; retries, so the pre-check must precede mutation.
